    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. We imported the nine-punch job. The control resolved nine ISO resources and threading points. The plot had 72 cutting blocks and separate cutting envelopes. The editor also exposed different resident quality values under the original quality names. See #2999 for the corrected import behavior.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
